(kicad_sch (version 20250114) (generator "aipe")
          (uuid "a6b4ce23-ac34-5bef-a096-f781c2d00a25") (paper "A2")
          (title_block (title "AIPE V2 SiC buck control board - 400 V (360-440 V) to 200 V / 25 A / 5 kW / 50 kHz synchronous buck; Wolfspeed C4MS025120K; TMS320F28335 control board on a stacked SELV mezzanine") (rev "V2.1")
            (comment 1 "AI-GENERATED ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE - V2.1 - HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED"))
          (lib_symbols )
          (text "AI-GENERATED ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE - V2.1 - HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED" (at 20 20 0)
          (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top))
          (uuid "9e3b8250-bcf9-5b10-849a-8081850191cf"))
(text "Design basis: examples/sic-buck-400v-200v-5kw/design/design_decisions.json (schema 3, 2026-10-10) - single source of truth; electrical model automation/kicad_tools/sic_buck_control_model.py; generator automation/kicad_tools/generate_sic_schematics.py.\n400 V (360-440 V) to 200 V / 25 A / 5 kW / 50 kHz synchronous buck; Wolfspeed C4MS025120K; TMS320F28335 control board on a stacked SELV mezzanine.\nNet classes: CTRL_SELV and Default 0.2 mm (35 um copper), CTRL_PWR for the supply rails (1.0 mm tracks, added assumption A-G2); the shared HV patterns are guards and match no net of this SELV board.\nBoard rules (.kicad_dru): the baseline class-pair rules are carried as guards; the control board must never carry HV copper and its copper never lies above HV copper of the power board (air clearance >= 11 mm, standards review item).\nPolarity adaptations A-C6 (UVLO flag inverted to UVLO_N) and A-C7 (raw PG_BIAS_x_N inverted before the AND combiner) use one SN74LV04A; the power board keeps the raw PG polarity on mezzanine pins 30/32/33.\nEvidence: native ERC manifests under verification/erc/<run>/run.json; review PDF under review/; this drawing has no CAD evidence beyond those runs. AI-GENERATED ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE - V2.1 - HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED." (at 20 31 0)
          (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
          (uuid "6679d058-8c6f-5a49-8eb3-ecede5aa1609"))
